WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Templates. Save a task or a whole project as a template and reuse it.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: onboarding; sprints.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Save a task or project → Shared with the workspace → Start new work from it

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:23.090
Save a task — with its subtasks — as a template.

5
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:31.830
Next time, start from it.

6
00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:38.950
Adjust the title — your edits win…

7
00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:46.950
…and the subtasks come along.

8
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:52.950
Finished subtasks weren't saved: Templates keep open subtasks only.

9
00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:57.450
Task and project templates
